docs {
  # List Files

  List files with optional filters.

  ## Query Parameters
  - `referenceType`: Filter by reference type (PATIENT, STUDY, SERIES, INSTANCE)
  - `referenceId`: Filter by reference ID
  - `category`: Filter by category (DICOM, AI_RESULT, CLINICAL_DOCUMENT, SYSTEM)
}
